# Build output — rebuilt by tools/package.sh, never committed.
dist/

# Generated and private PDFs.
#
# IMPORTANT: this line is why the repo is safe to make public. Reports exported
# while testing were generated from LIVE patient records and contain real
# patient names. They must never reach a commit — and because GitHub Pages
# publishes this docs/ folder, a committed one would also be served on the web.
# docs/sample-report.pdf is regenerable with `node tests/pdf.test.mjs`.
docs/*.pdf

# macOS
.DS_Store
